msgstr "移除 hosts"

msgid "Remove the cache plugin? Cached responses are discarded and the cache step is removed from the entry sequence."
msgstr "移除缓存插件？已缓存的响应将被丢弃，入口序列中的缓存步骤也会被移除。"

