msgstr "移除 hosts 插件？本地域名映射将被丢弃，入口序列中的 hosts 步骤也会被移除。"

msgid "Remove the subscription download plugin? Subscription downloads stop and the plugin with all of its download options is removed. The ad filtering rules and downloaded files on disk stay."
msgstr "移除订阅下载插件？订阅下载将停止，插件及其所有下载选项都会被移除。广告过滤规则和磁盘上已下载的文件会保留。"

msgid "Runtime Logs"
msgstr "运行日志"

msgid "LuCI backend"
msgstr "LuCI 后端"

msgid "LuCI can install the latest OxiDNS release, update the installed core, or install an uploaded .tar.gz archive or single oxidns binary. Install WebUI downloads the latest official release and replaces the core binary together with the WebUI files."
msgstr "LuCI 可以安装最新 OxiDNS release、更新已安装的内核，也可以安装上传的 .tar.gz archive 或单个 oxidns 二进制。“安装 WebUI”会下载官方最新 release，并同时替换内核二进制和 WebUI 文件。"

